{
  "title": { "zh": "异或" },
  "tray": "pipeline",
  "after": {
    "zh": "一条直线怎么摆都分不开异或。两个神经元先各画一条线，把每个点变成两个新的数，输出神经元在新的坐标里一条线就够了：这就是隐藏层。还有一件事：几个神经元一开始完全一样，训练时每一步的变化也一样，永远学不出不同的东西，所以网络的权重要从不同的随机数开始。"
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"4-5\"></level-ref>的 X 和 O 在平面上各占一边。这一关换了规则：X 是「只有一种笔画」，O 是「两种都有，或者都没有」。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"4-5\"></level-ref>搭的 1 / (1 + e^(−z)) 现在是现成的元件<part-ref to=\"sigmoid\"></part-ref>。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关你要做的：X 输出大于 0.6，O 小于 0.4。要想的问题：一个神经元是一条分界线，这些点能被一条直线分开吗？"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "4-6",
      "kind": "graph",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "换了一批字母：X 是「只有一种笔画」（斜多弯少，或弯多斜少），O 是「两种都多，或者都少」。X 输出大于 0.6，O 小于 0.4。"
      },
      "hint": {
        "zh": "先试一个神经元，在纸上画画这些点：一条直线分得开吗？神经元的输出，也可以交给另一个神经元。几个神经元一开始的权重一模一样的话，训练能让它们变得不一样吗？"
      },
      "inputs": ["f1", "f2"],
      "inputLabels": { "f1": { "zh": "斜笔画" }, "f2": { "zh": "弯笔画" } },
      "check": { "tolerance": 0.4 },
      "trainRate": 10,
      "scene": "strokes",
      "tests": [
        { "label": { "zh": "X (0.85, 0.15)" }, "letter": "X", "f1": 0.85, "f2": 0.15 },
        { "label": { "zh": "X (0.15, 0.85)" }, "letter": "X", "f1": 0.15, "f2": 0.85 },
        { "label": { "zh": "X (0.8, 0.25)" }, "letter": "X", "f1": 0.8, "f2": 0.25 },
        { "label": { "zh": "X (0.25, 0.8)" }, "letter": "X", "f1": 0.25, "f2": 0.8 },
        { "label": { "zh": "X (0.9, 0.3)" }, "letter": "X", "f1": 0.9, "f2": 0.3 },
        { "label": { "zh": "X (0.3, 0.9)" }, "letter": "X", "f1": 0.3, "f2": 0.9 },
        { "label": { "zh": "O (0.15, 0.15)" }, "letter": "O", "f1": 0.15, "f2": 0.15 },
        { "label": { "zh": "O (0.85, 0.85)" }, "letter": "O", "f1": 0.85, "f2": 0.85 },
        { "label": { "zh": "O (0.2, 0.3)" }, "letter": "O", "f1": 0.2, "f2": 0.3 },
        { "label": { "zh": "O (0.8, 0.75)" }, "letter": "O", "f1": 0.8, "f2": 0.75 }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        { "label": { "zh": "O (0.5, 0.45)" }, "letter": "O", "f1": 0.5, "f2": 0.45 },
        { "label": { "zh": "O (0.55, 0.6)" }, "letter": "O", "f1": 0.55, "f2": 0.6 }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "hw1 = lrnConst[p=[4.0805]]()",
        "hw2 = lrnConst[p=[-4.3363]]()",
        "hc = lrnConst[p=[-1.8815]]()",
        "kw1 = lrnConst[p=[-3.8893]]()",
        "kw2 = lrnConst[p=[4.0587]]()",
        "kc = lrnConst[p=[-2.0048]]()",
        "ow1 = lrnConst[p=[4.496]]()",
        "ow2 = lrnConst[p=[4.3862]]()",
        "oc = lrnConst[p=[-1.9479]]()",
        "h1 = arith[op=mul](f1, hw1)",
        "h2 = arith[op=mul](f2, hw2)",
        "k1 = arith[op=mul](f1, kw1)",
        "k2 = arith[op=mul](f2, kw2)",
        "hs = arith[op=add](h1, h2)",
        "ks = arith[op=add](k1, k2)",
        "hb = arith[op=add](hs, hc)",
        "kb = arith[op=add](ks, kc)",
        "hq = lrnSigmoid(hb)",
        "kq = lrnSigmoid(kb)",
        "o1 = arith[op=mul](hq, ow1)",
        "o2 = arith[op=mul](kq, ow2)",
        "os = arith[op=add](o1, o2)",
        "ob = arith[op=add](os, oc)",
        "oq = lrnSigmoid(ob)",
        "out <- oq"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "ow1 = lrnConst[p=[2.5611]]()",
        "ow2 = lrnConst[p=[-1.3987]]()",
        "oc = lrnConst[p=[-0.3669]]()",
        "o1 = arith[op=mul](f1, ow1)",
        "o2 = arith[op=mul](f2, ow2)",
        "os = arith[op=add](o1, o2)",
        "ob = arith[op=add](os, oc)",
        "oq = lrnSigmoid(ob)",
        "out <- oq"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
